Name=ParsLinux AMD & Intel Installer
Name[tr]=ParsLinux AMD & Intel Grafik Yöneticisi
Name[pt]=Instalador AMD e Intel ParsLinux
GenericName=AMD & Intel Graphics Manager
GenericName[tr]=AMD & Intel Grafik Yöneticisi
GenericName[pt]=Gestor de Gráficos AMD e Intel
Comment=Easily configure AMD Radeon and Intel graphics drivers, Vulkan, VA-API and hybrid GPUs
